    {
      "text": "You can view, edit, or delete a scheduled executive report, when required."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Viewing Scheduled Executive Reports",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To view scheduled executive reports:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Analytics > Report Management.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          15
        ],
        [
          18,
          35
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Report Management page, click the Scheduled Reports tab.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          24
        ],
        [
          41,
          58
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A list of scheduled executive reports is displayed."
    },
    {
      "item": "Search for a specific scheduled executive report.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the required columns that must be shown in the table. To learn more, see Using Tables.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
